<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<!DOCTYPE concept PUBLIC "-//OASIS//DTD DITA 1.3 Concept//EN" "concept.dtd">
<concept id="t00115">
	<title id="e00819">Removal and installation</title>
	<conbody>
		<table colsep="1" frame="none" outputclass="formatc_none" rowsep="1" id="e00820">
			<tgroup cols="2" colsep="0" rowsep="1">
				<colspec colname="col1" colnum="1" colsep="0" colwidth="50*"/>
				<colspec colname="col2" colnum="2" colsep="0" colwidth="50*"/>
				<tbody>
					<row rowsep="1">
						<entry colname="col1">
							<fig id="e00821">
								<figgroup>
									<image href="../../images/OOV025019.eps" align="center" height="1.740in" placement="break" id="e00822"/>
								</figgroup>
							</fig>
						</entry>
						<entry colname="col2"/>
					</row>
				</tbody>
			</tgroup>
		</table>
		<ul>
			<li>
				<p>To remove the headrest, raise it as far as it can go then press the release button (2) while pulling the headrest up (1).</p>
			</li>
			<li>
				<p>To reinstall the headrest, put the headrest poles into the holes (3) while pressing the release button (2).</p>
			</li>
			<li>
				<p>Then adjust it to the appropriate height.</p>
			</li>
		</ul>
		<note type="warning">
			<p>Make sure the headrest locks in position after adjusting it to properly protect the occupants.</p>
		</note>
	</conbody>
</concept>